  "2026-09-01T15:48:14.615Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-09-01: history writes now carry public event_class=v1 classification; explicit classifications win, update patch fields are classified by declared policy, and unknown operations fail closed as substantive. The v3 event index supports latest-substantive reads with authoritative fallback. Context relevance and persisted signal snapshots derive recency from the latest substantive history event, then release cohort, then created_at, and never bare updated_at; explained context/next expose source, coordinate, history operation, and event class. A temporary-project acceptance proved a dependency-only maintenance write left the substantive recency coordinate byte-for-byte unchanged while CLI and PmClient returned the expected items. Static quality passed with public-surface and replication gates; exact coverage passed 596 files / 8260 tests at 60874 statements, 46011 branches, 12674 functions, and 58599 lines, all 100%. Supported Node 24 scale check remained within product bounds."
  "2026-09-01T17:16:28.944Z","harness:codex","Review round evidence: accepted findings added the real history:author-acknowledge, history_compact_baseline, and tests_remove maintenance operations; invalid persisted event_class values now fall through to the versioned classifier; history index v4 records authoritative stream byte sizes and rejects stale-but-valid projections before rebuilding; latest-event maps use null prototypes; signal snapshot v3 fingerprints exact recency evidence; DatabaseSync replication detects declarations and assignments. Non-absence I/O errors remain authoritative failures. Linked focused suite passed 49/49 and repo coverage passed 60,928/60,928 statements, 46,039/46,039 branches, 12,685/12,685 functions, 58,650/58,650 lines."
  "2026-09-01T18:28:29.526Z","harness:codex","Late-review hardening evidence: context snapshot freshness now fingerprints every item's effective recency provenance, including release-cohort and created_at fallbacks; optional substantive-history fields are isolated in their negative control. History-index rebuilds persist byte sizes captured with the authoritative pre-read snapshot, so a concurrent append leaves a detectable conservative mismatch rather than certifying old rows against a new size. Focused context/history suites passed, including the concurrent-append regression."
  "2026-09-01T19:41:37.247Z","harness:codex","CodeRabbit follow-up evidence: v4 documentation now matches the runtime index; ContextSignalSnapshotItem requires ContextSignalProvenance on the public surface; persisted recency rejects maintenance history as substantive and rejects history fields on release/created fallbacks. Cross-process compliant appends now hold SQLite BEGIN IMMEDIATE across authoritative append, row insertion, and byte-size capture; append failure preserves the prior index, while post-append projection failure preserves history and removes the derived index. Focused 165-test coverage passed; exact repo coverage is 60,949/60,949 statements, 46,049/46,049 branches, 12,688/12,688 functions, and 58,670/58,670 lines; full static, zero-clone, docstring, contract, SDK surface, and record-integrity gates passed."
  "2026-09-01T19:59:44.203Z","harness:codex","Terminal review-fix evidence: history append/index coordination now acquires a SQLite BEGIN IMMEDIATE write transaction with a 5-second busy timeout before the authoritative append, serializes concurrent writers through committed byte-size capture, refuses the append if the lock cannot be acquired, preserves the prior projection when the authoritative append fails, and removes only the derived index when post-append projection work fails. Context signal snapshots now require parser-aligned typed provenance and reject contradictory fallback/history provenance; docs identify the current v4 index. Negative controls cover lock refusal, append failure, post-append projection failure, concurrency ordering, and contradictory provenance. Final full coverage: statements 60953/60953, branches 46049/46049, functions 12688/12688, lines 58674/58674. Final pnpm quality:static passed."
